# Same 1ES public proxy as the root .npmrc -- see the comment there for why the
# URL is committed and why it does not touch the lockfile.
#
# It is repeated here rather than inherited because this directory is not a
# workspace member: CI installs it on its own, `working-directory:
# packages/maximal/site` running `bun install --frozen-lockfile`, so bun's
# config lookup starts here and not at the repo root. Pinning it at the
# boundary where the separate install actually happens does not depend on
# whether bun walks up to a parent .npmrc.
#
# If this file is deleted, the site's dependencies quietly resolve from npmjs
# while every other package in the repo comes from the proxy.
registry=https://packagefeedproxy.microsoft.io/npm/
